# slop-haus agent workspaces. Any checkout of this repo can be pointed at
# a slop-haus server (see slop-haus/README.md), which writes these into it.
# All of them are per-checkout: .slop-haus.env holds that agent's bearer
# token, and settings.json names an absolute path on one machine.
